旅游趋势","summary": "2025年日本旅行收支逆差达57.54亿美元历史新高。韩国游客在日本消费约84.4亿美元，日本游客在韩国消费仅约27.4亿美元。","source": "韩国银行经济统计系统","impact": "旅行收支逆差扩大反映出日本outbound旅游增长快于inbound，需加强吸引高消费游客。","source_url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=2025%E5%B9%B4%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%97%85%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%B6%E6%94%AF%E9%80%86%E5%B7%AE%E5%88%9B%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%98 | https://www.google.com/search?q=2025%E5%B9%B4%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%97%85%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%B6%E6%94%AF%E9%80%86%E5%B7%AE%E5%88%9B%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%98#fe038cfa","key_figures": [],"travel_advisory": "","tag": "新","country": "日本","consecutive_days": 1},{"title": "08-06|日本|📈 旅游趋势|旅游趋势|2。。。。。。。。","category": "📈 旅游趋势","sub_category": "旅游趋势","summary": "日元持续走弱使日本对国际游客更加经济实惠。日本的旅游氛围以安静的完美与传统著称，提供Omotenashi文化体验。","source": "国际旅游媒体","impact": "日元贬值红利有助于吸引东南亚、欧美等替代客源市场。","source_url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%A5%E5%85%83%E8%B5%B0%E5%BC%B1%E4%BD%BF%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%AF%B9%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E6%B8%B8%E5%AE%A2%E6%9B%B4%E5%8A%A0%E5%AE%9E%E6%83%A0 | https://www.google.com/search?q=%E6%97%A5%E5%85%83%E8%B5%B0%E5%BC%B1%E4%BD%BF%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%AF%B9%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E6%B8%B8%E5%AE%A2%E6%9B%B4%E5%8A%A0%E5%AE%9E%E6%83%A0#ff4727fc","key_figures": [],"travel_advisory": "","tag": "新","country": "日本","consecutive_days": 1},{"title": "08-06|日本|📋 出入境政策|出入境政策|2。。。。。。","category": "📋 出入境政策","sub_category": "出入境政策","summary": "日本明确旅游发展策略转型方向，不再单纯追求游客数量增长，而是通过提高签证门槛吸引消费能力更强的游客。","source": "日本政府/观光厅","impact": "质量优先策略可能使短期游客量下降，但长期有望提升人均消费水平。","source_url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E8%BD%AC%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E8%BF%BD%E6%B1%82%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E8%BD%AC%E5%90%91%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F | https://www.google.com/search?q=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E8%BD%AC%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E8%BF%BD%E6%B1%82%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E8%BD%AC%E5%90%91%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F#e1982d0e","key_figures": [],"travel_advisory": "","tag": "新","country": "日本","consecutive_days"